<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Burn</h1>
<p>Sphere: Fire Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 0)
Mana: 10
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast burn &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast burn</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster utters the word 'Inceriti', and a small magical fire springs up 
on the target. It is the first fire spell a sorcerer learns, and the 
weakest: the better your magic and your fire sphere, the more it burns. It 
does about as well against any armour, a little better against plate, and 
a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
